## Arquivos de cache e pacotes do NuGet (Como os que aparecem na sua pasta obj)
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
project.assets.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

